## 2. Provider 인터페이스 정의

`src/providers/provider.ts`

```ts
export type ProviderType = 'email' | 'sms';

export interface SendMessageInput {
  to: string;
  subject?: string;
  content: string;
}

export interface SendMessageResult {
  success: boolean;
  provider: string;
  messageId?: string;
  error?: string;
}

export interface MessageProvider {
  readonly name: string;
  readonly type: ProviderType;

  send(input: SendMessageInput): Promise<SendMessageResult>;

  isAvailable?(): Promise<boolean>;
}
```

포인트:

- `MessageProvider`는 모든 provider가 따라야 하는 공통 계약입니다.
- `isAvailable()`는 선택 사항으로 두어, 헬스체크나 장애 우회에 활용할 수 있습니다.

---

## 3. Provider 구현체

### Email Provider

`src/providers/email.provider.ts`

```ts
import {
  MessageProvider,
  SendMessageInput,
  SendMessageResult,
} from './provider';

export class EmailProvider implements MessageProvider {
  readonly name = 'email-provider';
  readonly type = 'email' as const;

  async send(input: SendMessageInput): Promise<SendMessageResult> {
    if (!input.subject) {
      return {
        success: false,
        provider: this.name,
        error: 'Email subject is required',
      };
    }

    // 실제 구현에서는 외부 이메일 API 호출
    console.log(`[EmailProvider] sending email to=${input.to}`);

    return {
      success: true,
      provider: this.name,
      messageId: `email-${Date.now()}`,
    };
  }

  async isAvailable(): Promise<boolean> {
    return true;
  }
}
```

### SMS Provider

`src/providers/sms.provider.ts`

```ts
