# 7) 유틸 함수

## 셔플

```ts
function shuffleCandidates(
  candidates: [CandidateResponse, CandidateResponse]
): {
  shuffled: [CandidateResponse, CandidateResponse];
  candidateOrder: [Provider, Provider];
  wasShuffled: boolean;
} {
  const flip = Math.random() < 0.5;
  const shuffled = flip
    ? [candidates[1], candidates[0]]
    : [candidates[0], candidates[1]];

  return {
    shuffled: shuffled as [CandidateResponse, CandidateResponse],
    candidateOrder: [shuffled[0].provider, shuffled[1].provider],
    wasShuffled: flip,
  };
}
```

## JSON 파싱 보정

judge가 가끔 코드블록으로 감싸므로 제거합니다.

```ts
function extractJson(text: string): string {
  const trimmed = text.trim();

  if (trimmed.startsWith("```")) {
    return trimmed
      .replace(/^```json\s*/i, "")
      .replace(/^```\s*/i, "")
      .replace(/\s*```$/, "")
      .trim();
  }

  return trimmed;
}
```

## 점수 합산

```ts
function aggregateScores(result: JudgeLLMResultParsed): { A: number; B: number } {
  let A = 0;
  let B = 0;

  for (const c of result.criteria) {
    A += c.scoreA;
    B += c.scoreB;
  }

  return { A, B };
}
```

